            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor expressed uncertainty about how the parties might avoid the issue."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e25f15dd25d6f23945887dda358dcac24a8632ecf7a22dce8ce4d08742f73946",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-e25f15dd25d6-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 58,
              "start": 58
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens asked whether the U.S. Attorney could bind the respondent through a settlement."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e25f15dd25d6f23945887dda358dcac24a8632ecf7a22dce8ce4d08742f73946",
            "evidence_ids": [
